data: {"id": "574b6f447ff843da-thinking-parallel_evidence-2248", "run_id": "574b6f447ff843da", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与结论\n\n### 根因确凿：**ConfigMap 不存在导致 Volume 挂载失败**\n\n**支持证据：**\n\n1. **kubectl_events** 明确记录了反复的 `FailedMount` 事件：\n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（46分钟内重复28次）\n   - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition`（44分钟内重复20次）\n\n2. **kubectl_describe** 确认 Pod 处于 **Pending** 阶段，`ContainerCreating` 状态，`Container ID` 为空（容器根本没有启动）。\n\n3. **Pod YAML** 确认：volume `input` 绑定 ConfigMap `unavailable", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788418697436, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

